hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27993","Abd Allah ibn Yazid narrated to us: Said, meaning Ibn Abi Ayyub, narrated to us, he said: Abu al-Aswad narrated to me, from Urwah, from Aishah, from Judamah bint Wahb, the sister of Ukkashah, she said: I attended the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, among people, while he was saying: I intended to forbid ghilah, then I looked at Rome and Persia, and they practice ghilah with their children, and that does not harm their children at all. Then they asked him about withdrawal, and the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: That is the hidden infanticide, and it is: When the buried girl is asked."
